/* Chinese (Simplified). */

/* AppDelegate */
"Let Clipline handle your screenshots?" = "让 Clipline 接管你的截图？";
"Screenshots will hang on the line the instant you take them, without the floating thumbnail, and will not pile up on your Desktop. Drag one to a folder to keep it, or discard it with the cross. You can turn this off from the menu bar, and your settings come back when Clipline quits." = "你截图的那一瞬间，图片就会挂到晾衣绳上——没有浮动缩略图，也不会堆到桌面上。拖进文件夹即保留，点叉即丢弃。随时可以从菜单栏关掉，退出 Clipline 后你的设置会自动还原。";
"Turn on" = "开启";
"Not now" = "以后再说";
"Hide line" = "隐藏晾衣绳";
"Show line" = "显示晾衣绳";
"Handle screenshots" = "接管截图";
"Screenshots hang instantly and skip the Desktop" = "截图即刻挂上，不再经过桌面";
"Open screenshots folder" = "打开截图文件夹";
"Sounds" = "声音";
"Open at login" = "登录时打开";
"Quit Clipline" = "退出 Clipline";
"Could not change the login setting" = "无法更改登录项设置";
"Move Clipline to the Applications folder and try again." = "请先把 Clipline 移到「应用程序」文件夹，再试一次。";

