"The app it came from keeps it in its own protected folder. Give Clipline Full Disk Access to drop pictures from apps like WeChat, or copy the picture (⌘C) instead: copied pictures hang without it." = "这张图存在来源 app 自己的受保护文件夹里。给 Clipline 开启「完全磁盘访问权限」后，就能从微信这类 app 直接拖图上绳；或者改用复制（⌘C），复制的图片不需要这个权限也会挂上。";
